      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 106606201,
      "text": "ロテカ・ミリコイデス は、シソ科ロテカ属の常緑低木。旧クサギ属。英名にbutterflyが含まれるのは、花の姿が蝶に似ていることに因む。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Rotheca myricoides」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rotheca_myricoides",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1356814018,
      "text": "Rotheca myricoides or Butterfly Clerodendrum, Butterfly Bush, and is a species of flowering plant in the family Lamiaceae. It is native to tropical eastern Africa and widely cultivated elsewhere. In cultivation, it is frequently known by one of its synonyms, such as Clerodendrum myricoides."
